  "description": "The proposal is for a sensitive and appropriate renovation of the landscape & hedge to the front boundary along with the inclusion of a new set of gates and enlarged driveway.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The works as submitted would adversely impact upon the character appearance of the application site and the wider Pinner Hill Conservation Area and would result in the loss of soft, landscaped front greenery that contributes to the green informal semi-rural character that forms a key part of the Pinner Hill Conservation Area’s special character and appearance. Furthermore, no clear and convincing justification, nor public benefits to outweigh the harm, have been demonstrated to justify the proposals,&amp;nbsp;contrary to the requirements of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024),&amp;nbsp;London Plan (2021) policies,&amp;nbsp; HC1 C,&amp;nbsp;Harrow Core Strategy (2012) policy CS1, Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) policies&amp;nbsp;DM1,DM 7, Emerging New Harrow Local Plan (2025) Policies GR1 and HE1 and the Pinner Hill Conservation Area Appraisal and Management Strategy (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
